			<div class="content" id="post-content-2498711">
									

<p>This is my attempt at short horror.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">Inspiration&nbsp;behind&nbsp;SCP-2392</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">2392,&nbsp;Soudan&nbsp;and&nbsp;Ike</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Got inspiration for this during my camping trip - getting late at night and we were looking for a place to camp, so we pulled over at a spot called Soudan Station.<br />
Creepiest place I've ever been to - right next to the highway but hidden by really dense shrubs, only lights within a few twenty kilometers was our own headlights, and even those seemed like they couldn't penetrate the darkness. It was dead silent too, but in a really unsettling way. We let off some fireworks and shoved off - as we left, a nearby sign was illuminated by our headlights, the sign of some arse writing on it with blood red paint becoming evident.</p>
<p>So I wrote this as we went to the next place.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<hr />
<p>Check out <a href="https://m.youtube.com/watch?v=Gd6-JFalwaI">this awesome reading</a> by <a href="https://m.youtube.com/channel/UCCimlU7P-6omN5ezlWBst4Q">ReadOut!</a><br />
AND this translation on the <a href="http://ja.scp-wiki.net/scp-2392">Japanese</a> wiki!</p>

							</div>

								
