<p>While I accept most of your description, I find the test subject's statement to be overly convenient. You can do this in a few ways:</p>
<ul>
<li>Actually reveal a dead body hidden in that area. It would be better if you can play around with the typical &quot;dead body found by supernatural forces&quot; concept.</li>
<li>Have different people give differing and contradicting accounts of what they think happen to the area</li>
</ul>
<p>Beyond that, neutral vote for now.</p>

